    },
    "Pluck Studio adds local AI, the editing tools for DaVinci Resolve, the Logo Animator and Edit Anywhere. Your downloads, Library and settings stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pluck Studio bringt lokale KI, die Schnittwerkzeuge für DaVinci Resolve, den Logo-Animator und Überall bearbeiten mit. Deine Downloads, Mediathek und Einstellungen bleiben."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pluck Studio añade IA local, las herramientas de edición para DaVinci Resolve, el Animador de logos y Editar en cualquier lugar. Tus descargas, Biblioteca y ajustes se mantienen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pluck Studio ajoute l’IA locale, les outils de montage pour DaVinci Resolve, l’Animateur de logo et Monter partout. Vos téléchargements, votre Bibliothèque et vos réglages sont conservés."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pluck Studio aggiunge l’IA locale, gli strumenti di montaggio per DaVinci Resolve, l’Animatore di logo e Montaggio ovunque. Download, Libreria e impostazioni restano."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pluck Studio では、ローカル AI、DaVinci Resolve 用の編集ツール、ロゴアニメーター、どこでも編集が加わります。ダウンロード、ライブラリ、設定はそのまま残ります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pluck Studio에는 로컬 AI, DaVinci Resolve용 편집 도구, 로고 애니메이터, 어디서나 편집가 추가됩니다. 다운로드, 보관함, 설정은 유지됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pluck Studio voegt lokale AI, de montagetools voor DaVinci Resolve, de Logo-animator en Overal monteren toe. Je downloads, bibliotheek en instellingen blijven."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Pluck Studio adiciona IA local, as ferramentas de edição para o DaVinci Resolve, o Animador de logo e Editar de qualquer lugar. Seus downloads, Biblioteca e ajustes continuam."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pluck Studio 增加了本地 AI、DaVinci Resolve 剪辑工具、标志动画器和随处剪辑。你的下载内容、资料库和设置都会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pluck Studio’s tools (Derush, Find Shots, Live Recorder, Logo Animator, Fit Music, Edit Anywhere) are under the new Tools button and Tools menu. Features your Mac can’t run are no longer shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Werkzeuge von Pluck Studio (Derush, Einstellungen finden, Live-Recorder, Logo-Animator, Musik anpassen, Überall bearbeiten) findest du unter der neuen Tools-Taste und im Tools-Menü. Funktionen, die dein Mac nicht ausführen kann, werden nicht mehr angezeigt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las herramientas de Pluck Studio (Derush, Buscar planos, Grabador en directo, Animador de logos, Ajustar música, Editar en cualquier lugar) están en el nuevo botón y menú Herramientas. Ya no se muestran las funciones que tu Mac no puede ejecutar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les outils de Pluck Studio (Dérushage, Trouver des plans, Enregistreur en direct, Animateur de logo, Ajuster la musique, Monter partout) sont sous le nouveau bouton et menu Outils. Les fonctions que votre Mac ne peut pas exécuter ne s’affichent plus."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gli strumenti di Pluck Studio (Derush, Trova inquadrature, Registratore live, Animatore di logo, Adatta musica, Montaggio ovunque) sono nel nuovo pulsante e menu Strumenti. Le funzioni che il tuo Mac non può eseguire non vengono più mostrate."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pluck Studio のツール（素材の仕分け、ショットを探す、ライブレコーダー、ロゴアニメーター、音楽の長さ調整、どこでも編集）は、新しい「ツール」ボタンとツールメニューにまとめました。Mac で実行できない機能は表示されなくなりました。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pluck Studio의 도구(디러시, 샷 찾기, 라이브 레코더, 로고 애니메이터, 음악 길이 맞추기, 어디서나 편집)는 새 도구 버튼과 도구 메뉴에 있습니다. Mac에서 실행할 수 없는 기능은 더 이상 표시되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De tools van Pluck Studio (Derushen, Shots zoeken, Live-recorder, Logo-animator, Muziek passend maken, Overal monteren) staan onder de nieuwe Tools-knop en het menu Hulpprogramma's. Functies die je Mac niet kan uitvoeren, worden niet meer getoond."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As ferramentas do Pluck Studio (Decupagem, Encontrar planos, Gravador ao vivo, Animador de logo, Ajustar música, Editar de qualquer lugar) ficam no novo botão e menu Ferramentas. Recursos que seu Mac não pode executar não aparecem mais."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pluck Studio 的工具（粗剪整理、查找镜头、直播录制、标志动画器、音乐适配时长、随处剪辑）都在新的“工具”按钮和“工具”菜单中。你的 Mac 无法运行的功能不再显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
